---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import ButtonLink from '../../components/ButtonLink.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Integrated Payroll" description="Meet Integrated Payroll, Michigan's human-focused payroll and HR partner.">
	<PageHero title="About Integrated Payroll" subtitle="Michigan's human-focused payroll and HR partner." />
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container split">
			<div>
				<h2>About Integrated Payroll</h2>
				<p>Integrated Payroll is based in Traverse City, and most of our work has been built through relationships across Northern Michigan.</p>
				<p>We have never relied heavily on traditional marketing. Instead, our growth has come from introductions made by CPAs, advisors, and business owners who trust us to take care of the people they send our way.</p>
				<p>That has shaped how we operate.</p>
                <p>Because when someone makes that introduction, they are putting their name behind the experience that follows.</p>
                <p>We understand what is behind that.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="image-card"><img src="/assets/8.webp" alt="Integrated Payroll team member" width="500" height="625" /></div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="section section--gray"><div class="container centered"><h2>Right here in Northern Michigan</h2></div></section>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container split">
			<div class="image-card"><img src="/assets/12.webp" alt="Integrated Payroll team member" width="500" height="625" /></div>
			<div>
				<h2>Where our relationships come from</h2>
				<p>Most of the businesses we work with were introduced to us.</p>
                <p>Sometimes it starts with a simple conversation: "You should give them a call."</p>
				<p>From there, we step in, learn how the business operates, and take responsibility for making sure payroll is handled the right way.</p>
                <p>Over time, those relationships tend to stay in place.</p>
                <p>Not because of contracts or pressure, but because things are handled consistently and without creating unnecessary friction.</p>
				<ButtonLink href="/cpa-contact-form/" text="If you have a client who needs payroll help, feel free to reach out." />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container split">
			<div>
				<h2>How we approach the work</h2>
				<p>We focus on doing things the right way. That means paying attention to details, following through, and addressing issues before they become problems.</p>
                <p>It also means being accessible when something changes or when a question comes up.</p>
				<p>There is nothing complicated about it. But it does require consistency.</p>
				<ButtonLink href="/contact-us/" text="Give us a call! 231-935-0225" />
			</div>
			<div class="image-card"><img src="/assets/100.webp" alt="Integrated Payroll team member" width="500" height="625" /></div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>